{"game": "the-first-descendant", "language": "english", "appid": 2074920, "month": "2025-05", "window": 4, "start_date": 1748044800, "end_date": 1748735999, "month_true_total": 465, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-01 15:47:56 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "196110971", "author": {"steamid": "76561198309709899", "personaname": "Noroi86", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198309709899/", "num_games_owned": 519, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 80529, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1665, "playtime_at_review": 59462, "last_played": 1789771201, "avatar": "7e0e115c79668b02c19a6dbb947f6f1c2d95d008"}, "language": "english", "review": "Well, game is free and fun to play, anything(characters and weapons) you can get just by playing but you need to grind for it which can take a long time if RNGeesus is not on your side, you can skip most of it using IRL cash like in any other game of this type but its not mandatory. \n\nGame run smoothly and its not very demanding pc partwise but on older rigs you might need to make some sacrifices in how game looks for a decent performance...\n\nSo far i haven't noticed any bugs(or they were just so minor that they didn't do much) apart from some random crashes but im pretty sure that's on my side of things...\n\nI would rate it 8/10 only coz grind can be very boring and repetitive. But im just a casual gamer so take it with grain of salt and maybe give it a try and make your own judgement.", "timestamp_created": 1748732213, "timestamp_updated": 1748732299, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "196102110", "author": {"steamid": "76561198111638848", "personaname": "VET.Loki.USMC", "persona_status"