"review": "Honestly, i'm a grinder, i love grindy games, been playing waframe since 2014, but this one is just... flat... its just a buncha boobs, butts, pigtails, bikini's and fan service. I just cant get into it, wish i could. The gun-play is nice, the movement is so-so, the progression is tedious and flat, there is little to no pay off, you just grind and grind and grind, never really getting to the point where you 'enjoy the fruits of your labor' like in warframe.\r\n\r\nThe funny thing is this game reminded me so much of Anthem from 2019, that i went and downloaded it again and have been having a blast playing that instead.\r\n\r\nTL;DR: Im having more fun in a dead EA studios game from 5 years ago than in TFD, thats my review. GLHF", "timestamp_created": 1748717202, "timestamp_updated": 1748717202, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 93, "votes_funny": 11, "weighted_vote_score": "0.705554425716400146", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 6}, {"reaction_type": 13, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 15, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "196077514", "author": {"steamid": "76561198075774819", "personaname": "TehAzianz", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Tehazianz/", "num_games_owned": 67, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 466, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 419, "deck_playtime_at_review": 147, "last_played": 1748812695, "avatar": "7baa13c671732fd13a61ec13f2c4741e1e6ce9b4"}, "language": "english", "review": "Yeah", "timestamp_created": 1748704445, "timestamp_updated": 1748704445, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck":